00:26:24,468 --> 00:26:25,583
بِسْمِ الله رَبِّ الْغُلَامْ

333
00:26:25,623 --> 00:26:28,057
In the Name of Allah, the Lord of the boy.

334
00:26:28,604 --> 00:26:33,201
And the arrow hit him right in his head, and he immediately died.

