00:26:53,694 --> 00:26:56,752
I mean in the whole purpose of killing this boy is, to get rid of this religion

341
00:26:56,792 --> 00:27:00,983
and here we are stuck with our whole nation becoming Muslim.

342
00:27:02,134 --> 00:27:06,830
Actually, in this situation Christian but it is Islam, it is the oneness of Allahسبحانه وتعالى.

343
00:27:07,844 --> 00:27:10,894
Abu Nawaas(ابو نواس) instructed his soldiers to dig trenches,

344
00:27:11,444 --> 00:27:15,612
after they dig trenches, they filled them with wood, and ignite them.

345
00:27:16,354 --> 00:27:20,164
And anyone who refuses to give up their religion were forced them into the fire.

346
00:27:21,474 --> 00:27:24,593
And they would bring loads of people and burn them alive.

347
00:27:25,024 --> 00:27:30,136
And these are people who were holding firm to their faith and they didn't give up.

348
00:27:30,624 --> 00:27:37,234
And then Rasool Allah ﷺ says; there was a woman with her child in her arms, an infant

349
00:27:38,074 --> 00:27:42,873
and she was walking towards the fire but then she hesitated,

350
00:27:42,964 --> 00:27:45,214
imagine a mother carrying her infant.

