Surat Ul Buruj(سورة البروج) is referring to this story.

357
00:28:14,114 --> 00:28:16,774
Surat Ul Buruj(سورة البروج) talks about the ones, who are burned,

358
00:28:17,284 --> 00:28:19,304
As'haab Bil Ukhdood(أصحاب الأخدود) the people of the trench.

359
00:28:19,714 --> 00:28:27,102
Now, even though these people were burned alive, and they ceased to exist, and the king won.

