00:29:23,524 --> 00:29:24,935
Sumayyah(سميعه) has won,

375
00:29:25,164 --> 00:29:29,335
Hamza Bin Abdul Muttalib(حمزه بن عبدالمطلب), even though he was killed in the battlefield, he has won.

376
00:29:30,044 --> 00:29:33,382
They have won in the eternal sense of winning,

377
00:29:33,704 --> 00:29:37,688
even though they might have lost in a temporary battle in Duniyah(دُنِيَّا).

378
00:29:38,654 --> 00:29:43,489
But the eternal battle they have won it, because they have entered Jannah(جنة), and Allahسبحانه وتعالى says:

379
00:29:43,637 --> 00:29:45,078
ذَٰلِكَ الْفَوْزُ الْعَظِيْمْ

380
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:46,578
that is the great victory.

381
00:29:48,504 --> 00:29:50,334
There is one person, who survived.

382
00:29:51,134 --> 00:29:57,444
And this person traveled all the way to visit the Roman Emperor.

