00:29:58,044 --> 00:30:01,624
Now, he went to the Roman Empire because the Roman Empire was Christian,

384
00:30:02,341 --> 00:30:05,779
even though these two people would be different Christian sects,

385
00:30:06,250 --> 00:30:14,544
because by that time, the Romans might have already adopted the Trinity and the divinity of Eesa(عيسى).

