00:30:18,891 --> 00:30:22,047
So, he went to seek help from the Roman Emperor.

388
00:30:22,102 --> 00:30:25,039
He said, this is what happened to us, we were persecuted, we were killed.

389
00:30:25,489 --> 00:30:26,412
We need your help.!

390
00:30:26,729 --> 00:30:28,096
 The Roman Emperor said:

391
00:30:28,475 --> 00:30:30,201
We are too far from Yemen.

392
00:30:30,910 --> 00:30:37,390
But what, I could do, is send a message to the Najjashi(نجاشي),

393
00:30:37,676 --> 00:30:42,276
the Nagus, of Abyssinia, who's also a Christian, and he can help you.

394
00:30:43,012 --> 00:30:44,632
So, the Roman Emperor did that.

395
00:30:44,952 --> 00:30:49,622
And they sent the message to An-Najjashi(ألنجاشي), in English, the Nagus.

396
00:30:50,302 --> 00:30:56,792
And he sent an army led by a general named Ar-Rayyat(أرياط)

